      "content": "thanks. i checked the amount and it's definitely an integer in cents, so that wasnt it. i also checked the card status and it's definitely not an insufficient funds issue. is there any way to see the specific rejection reason from stripe's side? like a more detailed error message in the json? i feel like i'm just hitting a wall with these generic status codes.",
